# Milestone: v0.10.2-reactive (W6)
# Covers: sleep(duration) is a callable global that returns nil.
# Closes legacy audit F15 + v0.9.4-era Pico follow-up.
#
# Duration: UVAL_INT in microseconds.  Time literals: 1us = 1us = 1, 100ms = 100000.
# The REPL drives urbi_step; sleep parks the loader strand and the runtime
# resumes it after the sleep-queue timer fires.
#
# PASS criteria: sleep(1us) and sleep(0) return nil; code after sleep runs correctly.

# sleep(1us) returns nil.
sleep(1us)
[00000000] nil

# sleep(0) also returns nil (zero-duration sleep).
sleep(0)
[00000001] nil

# After a sleep, subsequent reads are unaffected (no out_slot corruption).
var x = 42
sleep(1us)
x
[00000002] 42
[00000003] nil
[00000004] 42
